* MINT-ERRORS: 27 10 37
* Ref: ../dbase3-decomp/specs/commands/navigation-query-display.md:911
? "[W2-BEGIN]"
USE BASE
? "[DEFAULT ALL NUMERIC FIELDS]"
SET TALK ON
SUM
SET TALK OFF
SUM BAL TO MRESULT
? MRESULT, EOF(), RECNO()
GO 1
SUM BAL NEXT 2 TO MRESULT
? "[NEXT TWO]", MRESULT
SUM BAL FOR BAL > 0 TO MRESULT
? "[POSITIVE BALANCES]", MRESULT
GO 2
DELETE
SET DELETED OFF
SUM BAL TO MRESULT
? "[DELETED OFF]", MRESULT
SET DELETED ON
SUM BAL TO MRESULT
? "[DELETED ON]", MRESULT
? "[NONNUMERIC EXPRESSION]"
SUM NAME TO MRESULT
? "[MISSING TO VARIABLE]"
SUM BAL TO
? "[NONLOGICAL SUM CONDITION]"
SUM BAL FOR 42 TO BADSUM
? "[W2-END]"
RETURN
